<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνελίσσω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνείλ-ειλ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll
				up in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίλφιον μέλιτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι εἰς ὀθόνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.713
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>wrap oneself in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἱματίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.95
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be wrapped in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγῳ ὄγμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					287
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1153.23
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνειλιγμένος τοὺς
				πόδας εἰς πίλους</span>
			<i>having</i> one's feet <i>wrapped in</i> . ., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				220b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wrap round,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήνεα ἠλακάτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					6.147
				</span></i>
			.</div>
